  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal Bridge Teguc</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rstudie bro Tegucigalpa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hiring of consultant Lars-Olof Eliasson (Eliasson &amp; Partner AB) to do an appraisal of a possible support to the a bridge in Tegucigalpa. The total cost of the bridge is calculated to be 35 MSEK. The Government of Honduras has asked Sweden for a non-reimbursable cost of 15 MSEK. The other 20 MSEK will be covered by an IDB loan administrated by SOPTRAVI. IDB will administrate the Swedish funds.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kontraktering av konsulten Lars-olof Eliasson (Eliasson &amp; Partner AB)f&#xf6;r att g&#xf6;ra en f&#xf6;rstudie av en bro i Tegucigalpa.Brons totalta kostnad ber&#xe4;knas bli 35 MSEK. Honduras regering har bett Sverige om 15 MSEK. &#xd6;vriga kostnader kommer att t&#xe4;ckas av ett IDB-l&#xe5;n som administreras av SOPTRAVI. IDB kommer att administrera de svenska fonderna.</narrative>
  </description>
